Comment=Make budgets, lists and sums, and open and save Excel files
Comment[fr]=Faites des budgets, des listes et des calculs, et ouvrez et enregistrez des fichiers Excel
Comment[nl]=Maak budgetten, lijsten en berekeningen, en open en bewaar Excel-bestanden
Comment[de]=Erstellen Sie Budgets, Listen und Berechnungen und öffnen und speichern Sie Excel-Dateien
Comment[es]=Haz presupuestos, listas y cálculos, y abre y guarda archivos de Excel
Comment[it]=Crea budget, elenchi e calcoli, e apri e salva file Excel
Comment[pt]=Crie orçamentos, listas e cálculos, e abra e guarde ficheiros Excel
Comment[pl]=Twórz budżety, listy i obliczenia oraz otwieraj i zapisuj pliki Excela
Comment[ar]=أنشئ الميزانيات والقوائم والعمليات الحسابية، وافتح ملفات Excel واحفظها
Comment[cs]=Vytvářejte rozpočty, seznamy a výpočty a otevírejte a ukládejte soubory Excelu
Comment[el]=Δημιουργήστε προϋπολογισμούς, λίστες και υπολογισμούς, και ανοίξτε και αποθηκεύστε αρχεία Excel
Comment[hi]=बजट, सूचियाँ और जोड़-घटाव बनाएँ, और Excel फ़ाइलें खोलें और सहेजें
Comment[hu]=Költségvetések, listák és számítások készítése, Excel-fájlok megnyitása és mentése
Comment[id]=Buat anggaran, daftar, dan perhitungan, serta buka dan simpan berkas Excel
Comment[ja]=予算、リスト、計算を作成し、Excel ファイルを開いて保存する
Comment[ko]=예산, 목록, 합계를 만들고 Excel 파일을 열고 저장합니다
Comment[pt_BR]=Crie orçamentos, listas e somas, e abra e salve arquivos do Excel
Comment[ro]=Creați bugete, liste și calcule, și deschideți și salvați fișiere Excel
Comment[ru]=Составляйте бюджеты, списки и расчёты, открывайте и сохраняйте файлы Excel
Comment[sv]=Gör budgetar, listor och summor, och öppna och spara Excel-filer
Comment[tr]=Bütçe, liste ve toplamlar hazırlayın, Excel dosyalarını açın ve kaydedin
Comment[uk]=Складайте бюджети, списки й розрахунки, відкривайте та зберігайте файли Excel
Comment[vi]=Lập ngân sách, danh sách và phép tính, đồng thời mở và lưu tệp Excel
Comment[zh_CN]=制作预算、列表和计算，打开和保存 Excel 文件
Comment[zh_TW]=製作預算、清單和計算，開啟及儲存 Excel 檔案
Comment[nb]=Lag budsjetter, lister og regnestykker, og åpne og lagre Excel-filer
Comment[da]=Lav budgetter, lister og regnestykker, og åbn og gem Excel-filer
Comment[fi]=Tee budjetteja, listoja ja laskelmia sekä avaa ja tallenna Excel-tiedostoja
Comment[th]=สร้างงบประมาณ รายการ และการคำนวณ รวมถึงเปิดและบันทึกไฟล์ Excel
Comment[ms]=Buat belanjawan, senarai dan jumlah, serta buka dan simpan fail Excel
Comment[fil]=Gumawa ng mga badyet, listahan at kuwenta, at magbukas at mag-save ng mga Excel file
Comment[bn]=বাজেট, তালিকা ও হিসাব তৈরি করুন এবং Excel ফাইল খুলুন ও সংরক্ষণ করুন
Comment[ta]=வரவு செலவுத் திட்டங்கள், பட்டியல்கள், கணக்குகளை உருவாக்கவும்; Excel கோப்புகளைத் திறக்கவும், சேமிக்கவும்
Comment[te]=బడ్జెట్‌లు, జాబితాలు, లెక్కలు రూపొందించండి మరియు Excel ఫైళ్లను తెరవండి, సేవ్ చేయండి
Comment[mr]=बजेट, याद्या आणि बेरजा तयार करा आणि Excel फायली उघडा व सेव्ह करा
Comment[sk]=Vytvárajte rozpočty, zoznamy a výpočty a otvárajte a ukladajte súbory Excelu
Comment[bg]=Правете бюджети, списъци и изчисления, отваряйте и записвайте файлове на Excel
Comment[hr]=Izrađuj proračune, popise i izračune te otvaraj i spremaj Excel datoteke
Comment[sr]=Прави буџете, спискове и прорачуне, те отварај и чувај Excel датотеке
Comment[sl]=Ustvarjajte proračune, sezname in izračune ter odpirajte in shranjujte datoteke Excel
Comment[lt]=Kurkite biudžetus, sąrašus ir skaičiavimus, atidarykite ir įrašykite Excel failus
Comment[lv]=Veidojiet budžetus, sarakstus un aprēķinus, atveriet un saglabājiet Excel failus
Comment[et]=Koosta eelarveid, loendeid ja arvutusi ning ava ja salvesta Exceli faile
Comment[ca]=Crea pressupostos, llistes i càlculs, i obre i desa fitxers d'Excel
Exec=wildos-tables %U
Icon=org.wildos.tables
Terminal=false
StartupNotify=true
StartupWMClass=libreoffice-calc
Categories=Office;Spreadsheet;
Keywords=excel;xlsx;xls;csv;spreadsheet;budget;sheet;ods;calc;
X-GIO-NoFuse=true
InitialPreference=9
MimeType=application/clarisworks;application/csv;application/excel;application/msexcel;application/tab-separated-values;application/vnd.apache.parquet;application/vnd.apple.numbers;application/vnd.lotus-1-2-3;application/vnd.ms-excel;application/vnd.ms-excel.sheet.binary.macroEnabled.12;application/vnd.ms-excel.sheet.macroEnabled.12;application/vnd.ms-excel.template.macroEnabled.12;application/vnd.ms-works;application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.chart;application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.chart-template;application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.spreadsheet;application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.spreadsheet-flat-xml;application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.spreadsheet-template;application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet;application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.template;application/vnd.stardivision.calc;application/vnd.stardivision.chart;application/vnd.sun.xml.calc;application/vnd.sun.xml.calc.template;application/x-123;application/x-dbase;application/x-dbf;application/x-dos_ms_excel;application/x-excel;application/x-gnumeric;application/x-iwork-numbers-sffnumbers;application/x-ms-excel;application/x-msexcel;application/x-quattropro;application/x-starcalc;application/x-starchart;text/comma-separated-values;text/csv;text/spreadsheet;text/tab-separated-values;text/x-comma-separated-values;text/x-csv;
Actions=NewDocument;

[Desktop Action NewDocument]
Name=New spreadsheet
Exec=wildos-tables --new
